WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.007 --> 00:00:06.597
Open Reminders in More

2
00:00:06.597 --> 00:00:08.500
Tap plus and choose a time

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Tap the weekdays to repeat on

4
